  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 48,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zakayo kūgwīlwa imote",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūshikīīla mu Yeliko; wabītaga mo dūhū alīlūmbūlīla ajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha nsabi, ntaale wa batobisha ba goodi; ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Zakayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmona ū Yesu ūmo alī, alīyo akalemeelwa nguno y'ibita lya banhū, nīyo hangī walī nguhī wa baguhī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wimeema nhambo ajile kū būtongi, ūūkalinha mu nkūyū gīkī amone chiza ū Yesu, nguno gwalī haho nī nzīla īyo wabītīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho washika a h'ipandī lyenīlo, ūlangamīla koi ū kwigūlya ūnola; hūna ūng'wīla, “Bebe Zakayo, ikaga wangū, nguno ī lelo yenīyī nakūdīla ha ng'wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akika wangū no, ūng'wegeleja na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho babona gīko, pye a bose bandya kūduguma balīhaya gīkī, “Bing'we mulībona, wingīla kwigasha mu kaya ya ng'wa munhū o shibi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla ū Zakayo wīmīīla, ūng'wīla ū Seeba gīkī, “Seeba ī nusu ya sabo yane nalībinha bahabī; hama nīyo nūūlū nanyeekeja munhū shikolo, nakūnshokeja ng'hangala ine!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ī lelo īyī būpīji wigelaga a ha kaya īyī, īkī nū ng'wenūyū nang'hwe ng'wana wa ng'wa Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Ng'wana wa Munhū wizile kūkooba na kūpīja īsho shijimīīlile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa basese na migabo ya hela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī būdegeleka ī mihayo yenīyo, ū Yesu ongeja kūbawīla lūsumo. Nguno akasangwa wegeela kūshikīīla ī Yelusalemu; hama nīyo a boi biganikaga gīkī ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu hū būkwilonga ī likanza lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūbawīla gīkī, “Olīho munhū nebe o lūganda lo nyatemi, akahaya kwīnga kūja kū sī ya kūle, gīkī akatemiwe; hanuma alashoke hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akitana basese bakwe ikūmi ūbagabanhya migabo ikūmi ya hela, ūbakomeleja alībawīla gīkī, ‘Jitūndanyagi jiibyale; nakwiza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba mu sī yakwe baalī batantogilwe, hūna lūūlū būtūma nhūng'wa kūnkūūbīja koi; būhaya gīkī, ‘A bise tūtatogilwe abize ntemi wise ū ng'wenūyū!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū ng'wenūyo aho owanukūla ū būtemi ūshoka; ūshikīla kūlagīla bitanwe a basese abo walī wabalekela hela, amane būlī ng'wene wapandīkile ginehe ū mu kūjitūndanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika wa kwandya ūhaya, ‘Baba ū ngabo gwa hela jako gwabyalile migabo ikūmi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūng'wīla, ‘Būgatū ū bebe ūlī nsese wawiza, īkī wabizile ng'wishigwa mu shikolo shido, wabizaga ntaale wa mizengo ikūmi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiza na wa kabīlī, nang'hwe ūhaya, ‘Baba ū ngabo gwa hela jako gwabyalile migabo itanò.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū ng'wene ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Nang'ho wabizaga ntaale wa mizengo ītanò.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ūngī wiza; lelo ū ng'wene ūshikīla kūhaya gīkī, ‘Baba gūyū ū ngabo gwa hela jako, naalī najibunga ng'widaso nūjibīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakogohile no, nguno nakūdeebile gīkī ūlī ng'wiboneeji, ūkasolaga nī shisho ūtashitūūlile bebe, hangī ūkagesaga nū kūko ūtabībile!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo ūnshokeja ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ūlī nsese wabūbi, na lūūlū nakūkwinha nsango, nguno nīyo wikaanīla bebe ng'wenekīlī na nomo gwako. Gashinaga walī ūmanile gīkī nalī ng'wiboneeji wa kūsola nī shisho natashitūūlile nene, na gīkī nakagesaga nū kūko natabībile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī lūūlū nahene ī hela jane ūtajitwalile nūūlū kū basūlūja, gīkī ūlū nūshoka nasange jibyalanile?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ūbawīla abo baalī bīmīīla hihī henaho gīkī, ‘Ntaajagi ī hela jenījo mung'winhe ūyo alī na migabo ikūmi ya hela.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būng'wīla, ‘Baba hama īkī ū ng'wenūyo alī na migabo ikūmi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nalīmuwīla būlī ng'wene ūyo alī na shikolo akwinhwa, alīyo ūyo atī nasho akūtaajiwa nī shigehu īsho alī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banishi bane abo batatogilwe nabize ntemi wabo, a bene begelejagi ha būtongi bone aha mubabūlage.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwingīla mu Yelusalemu nyatemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kūhaya ī yenīyo būbūūka bajile Yelusalemu, ū wei walī kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayegeela Betifage na Betania, kū lūgūlū ūlo lūkitanagwa lo mizeituni, ūtūma babīlī ba bahemba bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Jagi ū mu chalo īsho shilī kū būtongi shenīsho; ūlū mulingīle mo mukūbona nzobe mūūga ītungilwe, ītaalī kūdamhīlwa na munhū nūūlū ūmò, ītaligūlīlagi muyenhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ūlū ūmubūja gīkī, ‘Nibūlī mulīyītaligūlīla?’ Hayagi gīkī, ‘Nguno alī na nīmo nayo ū Seeba.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baja abo bakatūng'wa, būūkasanga ng'hana gīt'ūmo akabawīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayandya ū kwītaligūlīla, a benekīlī nzobe būbabūja, “Nibūlī mulīyītaligūlīla ī nzobe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būshosha, “Nguno alī na nīmo nayo ū Seeba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bīyenha ū kūlī Yesu ī nzobe yenīyo, aho bīshisha bītūūlīla myenda yabo a ha ngongo, būndamhīja ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ajile būyūja bakwambaga myenda yabo ū mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayegeela kū ntulumenho gwa lūgūlū lo mizeituni, pyī ī libita lya bahemba bandya kūnkūja na kūngongoola Mulungu n'ilaka lya higūlya kūlwa būdūla būtaale mu mihayo yose īyo baalī bībona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò ba Bafalisayo abo baalīmo ū ng'wibita būng'wīla, “Bebe Nangi, bahamage a bahemba bako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Nalīmuwīla gīkī a benaba nūūlū bakahuumūla, gakūyoganya mawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegeela hihī wahayūgūbona ū nzengo, ūūgūlīlīīla ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīhaya gīkī, “Gīt'ūlū ni wabiza wīmanile nang'ho ī mihayo ya mhola ī lelo! Al'ī gīsī, ībisilwe ū kū miso gako! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno jikūshika shikū ja banishi bako kūkūgobanīja hose hose, bakūzengeele ndūgū ya kūkūpīndīlīja, bayūkūdumīla kūfuma mhandī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūkūtaalīka ha sī ū bebe ng'wenekīlī, pye na a baana bako abo ūlī nabo; batūkūlekela iwe nūūlū līmò higūlya y'iwe lichalyo, nguno ūtalīmanile ī likanza lya kūsangwa kwako!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwejiwa kwa hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wingīla ū mu hekalu ūbapeeja abo bīītīlaga mo byashala būfuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Yandīkilwe gīkī, ‘ī numba yane īkūbiza numba y'ilomba; alīyo a bing'we mukūyītaga kūbiza ipilinga lya basambo!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūdīla mu hekalu būlī lūshikū akūlangaga; alīyo a bagabīji bataale na a balangi ba shilagīlo, hamò na a basugi ba banhū bakoobaga kūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike baalī bagayiwa ū gwa kūng'wītīla, nguno pye a banhū bikalaga hamò nang'hwe bakūndegelekaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
